# Scroll Physics Convention

All scrollable widgets **must** use `BouncingScrollPhysics()` as their `physics` parameter.

This applies to: `ListView`, `SingleChildScrollView`, `GridView`, `CustomScrollView`, `PageView`, `TabBarView`, and any other scrollable widget.

```dart
// ✅ GOOD
ListView(
  physics: const BouncingScrollPhysics(),
  children: [...],
)

SingleChildScrollView(
  physics: const BouncingScrollPhysics(),
  child: ...,
)

// ❌ BAD — missing physics or using other physics
ListView(
  children: [...],
)

SingleChildScrollView(
  physics: const ClampingScrollPhysics(),
  child: ...,
)
```
